Semantic TechStore Website
Project Description

Semantic TechStore Website is a responsive e-commerce website developed using HTML5 and CSS3. The project demonstrates the proper use of HTML5 semantic tags to create a well-structured, accessible, and SEO-friendly webpage. It features a modern layout with a navigation bar, hero banner, featured products, offers section, and footer. The website is designed to provide a clean user interface while following web development best practices.

Technologies Used
1. HTML5

Definition:
HTML5 (HyperText Markup Language version 5) is the standard markup language used to create and structure web pages. It defines the content of a webpage using elements and tags.

Purpose in this project
Creates the webpage structure.
Displays text, images, buttons, and links.
Uses semantic tags for better organization.
Improves accessibility and SEO.
2. CSS3

Definition:
CSS (Cascading Style Sheets) is a stylesheet language used to control the appearance and layout of HTML elements. CSS separates the design from the content, making websites visually appealing and responsive.

Purpose in this project
Styles the webpage.
Adds colors, fonts, spacing, and layouts.
Creates responsive product cards.
Adds hover effects and modern UI.
HTML5 Semantic Tags Used
<header>

Definition:
Defines the introductory section of a webpage, typically containing the logo, website title, and navigation.

Used for:

Website logo
Website title
<nav>

Definition:
Defines a navigation section containing links to different pages.

Used for:

Home
Products
Offers
Contact
<main>

Definition:
Represents the primary content of the webpage.

Used for:

Hero Banner
Product Section
Offers
<section>

Definition:
Groups related content into logical sections.

Used for:

Hero Banner
Featured Products
<article>

Definition:
Represents independent and self-contained content.

Used for:
Each product card:

Laptop
Smartphone
Smart Watch
<aside>

Definition:
Contains additional or secondary information related to the main content.

Used for:

Special Offers
Discounts
Announcements
<footer>

Definition:
Defines the footer section containing copyright information and contact details.

Used for:

Copyright
Email
Social information
CSS Properties Used
Property	Purpose
