Suitable for beginners and portfolio projects.
Conclusion

The Semantic TechStore Website is a beginner-friendly front-end project that demonstrates how to build a modern e-commerce webpage using HTML5 and CSS3. It follows HTML5 semantic standards to create a clean, accessible, and SEO-friendly structure while using CSS3 to deliver a responsive and visually appealing user interface. This project is ideal for learning semantic HTML, responsive layouts, and basic web design concepts, and it serves as a strong portfolio project for aspiring web developers.
